    cineris-base program::tests::by_windows_rules_a_runnable_is_looked_for_a_directory_at_a_time

[break] runnable-takes-a-ps1
rule: The three extensions tried on Windows are .exe, .cmd and .bat, never .ps1.
file: crates/cineris-base/src/program.rs
in: WINDOWS_RUNNABLE
in-string: bat
replace: ps1
caught-by:
    cineris-base program::tests::by_windows_rules_a_runnable_is_looked_for_a_directory_at_a_time

[break] runnable-takes-the-bare-name
rule: On Windows a name with no extension is never taken as the file of that bare name.
